{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-daeebaa77c3a","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-daeebaa77c3a","name":"空气炸锅面包片","category":"breakfast","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/breakfast/%E7%A9%BA%E6%B0%94%E7%82%B8%E9%94%85%E9%9D%A2%E5%8C%85%E7%89%87.md","blob_sha":"5def3fb885059bb2c68c756034ebe0fe051cfe44","details":{"introduction":"空气炸锅面包片是一道极简快手的主食，外脆内软，麦香纯粹，特别适合减脂期食用。它富含膳食纤维和植物蛋白，能提供较长时间的饱腹感。做法毫无门槛，只需将面包片放入空气炸锅即可，对新手极其友好，从准备到完成仅需大约五分钟。","difficulty":"★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 面包片\n- 空气炸锅"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"每份：\n\n- 面包片（两片）"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 取出两片面包片（建议使用粗粮面包片）\n2. 将面包片**垂直**放入空气炸锅\n3. 200°C 烘烤 5 分钟\n4. 取出即可使用"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"营养成分表（数据基于全麦面包片）\n\n- 热量 254 千卡\n- 蛋白质 12.3 克\n- 脂肪 3.5 克\n- 碳水化合物 43.1 克\n- 膳食纤维 6.0 克"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：白吐司150g；整份约145g。原味白吐司，不加黄油糖酱，烘烤水分变化由成品重假设表达。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":275.172414,"protein_g":9.155172,"carbohydrate_g":51.103448,"fat_g":3.444828},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174924/nutrients","version":"0381bb94ea367417","fdc_ids":[174924]},"profile_id":"family-daeebaa77c3a-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-daeebaa77c3a","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-daeebaa77c3a","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"bake","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-daeebaa77c3a-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"bread","grams":150}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data_version":"0381bb94ea367417","completeness":"complete","rules_version":"nutr